## 5계층 아키텍처

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  L5: Energy History    [EnergyPatternDB, EfficiencyLearner]│
│  L4: Green Consensus   [GreenRaftNode, PowerLeaderElection,│
│                         LowPowerReplication]              │
│  L3: Predictive PM     [EnergyPredictor, DemandResponse]  │
│  L2: Green Scheduler   [DVFSController, SleepManager,     │
│                         WorkloadConsolidator]             │
│  L1: Power Sensing     [PowerSensor, PowerPattern,        │
│                         BatteryPredictor]                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
단방향 데이터 흐름: L1→L2/L3/L4/L5, L5→L3 학습 피드백
```

